PlateMate — authors and contributors
====================================

This repository is the research artifact for an OZCHI '25 paper. The paper
authors are listed first, in publication order; see CITATION.cff for the full
citation.

Paper authors
-------------

    Wei-Lu Wang        Virginia Tech                        @WeiluWang
    Zeren Yan          Trine University                     @yaninsanity
    Xian Zheng         Trine University                     @xz-zx
    Wuyou Zhang        Virginia Tech                        @justinzhang2023F
    Yufei Cao          The Australian National University   @yufeicyf
    D. Scott McCrickard  Virginia Tech

Copyright in the code is held jointly by those who wrote it. "The PlateMate
authors" in LICENSE refers to this list.

Code contribution
-----------------

Figures come from the private repository this release was cut from, counting
every commit on every branch. Lines are additions plus deletions, so they
measure churn rather than surviving code.

    @yaninsanity         400 commits    ~189,000 lines
    @justinzhang2023F    207 commits     ~31,600 lines
    @xz-zx                82 commits     ~16,000 lines
    @ArcsZhang            19 commits          15 lines
    @WeiluWang             8 commits         431 lines

The published history starts from a single commit, so per-file authorship
cannot be recovered here. It remains in the private repository.
